  unitName: Christmas Light King (EU)
  unitId: 750203
  unitNumber: 7018
  description: This subspecies of Metal King is said to hold within its large body
    a huge collection of information on the element of light. They are referred to
    as "Metal Heroes" in collective research documents relating to the metal record
    species. What exactly the Metal Kings did to become known as heroes is unrecorded,
    but it seems everyone around them finds what they say somehow fascinating.
  summonDesc: Feel it!<br>The breath of the metal records!<br>This is our power!
